icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/109.0.5414.120/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"2a9b099bbb7e3363ea992a824471b78436ba9fa42a50b1725d025284326db478"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/109.0.5414.120/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"fc3e2458f17f8c42cc9937307f2dea83a401db51375d66fdeed5816f31be21d0"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/109.0.5414.120/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8f554732ba5ee13b8b732129d3a5322bbda7f019889892a17453f2ece3b1ccfc"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"109.0.5414.120"}